Package: ghostchat
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-cryptography
Description: Ephemeral encrypted P2P terminal messenger
 ghostchat is a peer-to-peer encrypted terminal chat application that
 leaves no trace. All key material and messages live only in RAM and
 are wiped on session end.
 .
 Features:
  * X25519 ECDH key exchange with HKDF-SHA256 key derivation
  * AES-256-GCM per-message encryption with random nonces
  * Optional passphrase gate via Scrypt + HMAC-SHA256
  * Curses TUI with split-pane chat layout
  * Zero disk writes — no logs, no temp files, no bytecode cache
  * Self-destruct (/burn) command to wipe both peers simultaneously
